# SESSION_LOG.md is an append-only local archive of WORKING.md — a
# coordination surface for agents working on the repo, NEVER
# committed. Prior leaks via SESSION_LOG.md required deleting and
# re-creating a CommonerLLP repo as remediation (see
# _org/mistakes.md). Keep this rule.
SESSION_LOG.md

