# Secrets — should never be in repo anyway, belt-and-suspenders
.env
.env.local
*.pem
*.key
secrets/
# Exception: the source-tree `partial_recall.secrets` package is
# part of the codebase (keyring + env-var resolution). Allow .py
# files; the package's __pycache__/ is still ignored by the
# generic __pycache__ rule above.
!src/partial_recall/secrets/
!src/partial_recall/secrets/*.py
